msgctxt "website"
msgid ""
"Our visual identity and product philosophy are built on four core principles "
"that guide every decision we make."
msgstr ""
"Notre identité visuelle et notre philosophie de produit reposent sur quatre "
"principes fondamentaux qui guident chaque décision que nous prenons."

#: .\templates\website\about.html:112
msgctxt "website"
msgid "Trust"
msgstr "Confiance"

#: .\templates\website\about.html:113
msgctxt "website"
msgid ""
"Visual clarity and consistency reinforce the perception of reliability. "
"Every interaction on FONTESIN is backed by verified data and auditable "
"processes."
msgstr ""
"La clarté visuelle et la cohérence renforcent la perception de fiabilité. "
"Chaque interaction sur FONTESIN est soutenue par des données vérifiées et "
"des processus auditables."

#: .\templates\website\about.html:119 .\templates\website\index.html:49
msgctxt "website"
msgid "Infrastructure"
msgstr "Infrastructure"

#: .\templates\website\about.html:120
msgctxt "website"
msgid ""
"The design feels structured and systematic rather than decorative. We are "
"building the backbone of global business communication, not a consumer app."
msgstr ""
"Le design semble structuré et systématique plutôt que décoratif. Nous "
"construisons l’épine dorsale de la communication commerciale mondiale, et "
"non une application grand public."

#: .\templates\website\about.html:126
msgctxt "website"
msgid "Simplicity"
msgstr "Simplicité"

#: .\templates\website\about.html:127
msgctxt "website"
msgid ""
"Minimalism supports scalability and global usability. Complex systems should "
"feel simple to use — that is the hardest engineering challenge we embrace."
msgstr ""
"Le minimalisme prend en charge l'évolutivité et la convivialité mondiale. "
"Les systèmes complexes doivent être simples à utiliser : c’est le défi "
"d’ingénierie le plus difficile que nous relevons."

